id: guard-down
name: Guard Down
kind: condition
description: >
  Flat-footed, pushed over, or in any situation that limits your defense, you
  become vulnerable.
text: >
  Reduce your Dodge Rolls and all Strike Rolls made through the Parry option
  of the Defend Maneuver by 2(T). Additionally, increase the Ki Point Cost of
  the Guard option of the Defend Maneuver by 1/2 (after all other
  calculations).

---

# Parry is its own Slot rather than Strike, because the penalty applies only
# when Strike is rolled defensively.
# Increasing a cost by 1/2 is multiplying it by 1.5, and a multiply lands on
# the finished value - which is what after all other calculations means.

[passive]
dodge -= 2(T);
parry -= 2(T);
defend.guard.kiCost *= 1.5;
